-Merge needs a view column defined by the same function, with the same parameters except
level (sql.md §7.4): sumMerge of a sumIf column (the hint names sumIfMerge), a
quantileDDMerge with another rel_acc, a merge of a key, and any merge in a stream query,
which has no states. -State has no place in a query either (DF5206).
-- dynaflux/clicks.sql --
CREATE STREAM clicks (
    site String,
    page String,
    ms   UInt32
)
PRIMARY KEY (site);

CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW site_daily
ORDER BY (site, day)
PRIMARY KEY (site)
AS SELECT
    site,
    toDate(event_time)    AS day,
    sumIf(ms, page != '') AS page_ms,
    quantileDD(0.01)(ms)  AS dd_ms
FROM clicks
GROUP BY site, day;

-- name: PageTotal :one
SELECT sumMerge(page_ms) AS total
FROM site_daily
WHERE site = {site:String};

-- name: CoarseQuantile :one
SELECT quantileDDMerge(0.02)(dd_ms) AS p50
FROM site_daily
WHERE site = {site:String};

-- name: KeyMerge :one
SELECT maxMerge(day) AS last_day
FROM site_daily
WHERE site = {site:String};

-- name: StreamMerge :one
SELECT sumMerge(ms) AS total
FROM clicks
WHERE site = {site:String};

-- name: StreamState :one
SELECT sumState(ms) AS total
FROM clicks
WHERE site = {site:String};
-- want --
dynaflux/clicks.sql:20:8: error DF4205
dynaflux/clicks.sql:25:8: error DF4205
dynaflux/clicks.sql:30:8: error DF4205
dynaflux/clicks.sql:35:8: error DF4205
dynaflux/clicks.sql:36:6: warning DF4501
dynaflux/clicks.sql:40:8: error DF5206
dynaflux/clicks.sql:41:6: warning DF4501
-- want-text --
dynaflux/clicks.sql:20:8: error DF4205: PageTotal: sumMerge(page_ms) needs a sum column of a view; page_ms is a sumIf column
  hint: for a sumIf column, use sumIfMerge(page_ms)
dynaflux/clicks.sql:25:8: error DF4205: CoarseQuantile: quantileDDMerge(dd_ms) needs a quantileDD column of a view; dd_ms is a quantileDD column with rel_acc 0.01
dynaflux/clicks.sql:30:8: error DF4205: KeyMerge: maxMerge(day) needs a max column of a view; day is a key of site_daily
dynaflux/clicks.sql:35:8: error DF4205: StreamMerge: sumMerge(ms) needs a sum column of a view; ms is a column of stream clicks
dynaflux/clicks.sql:36:6: warning DF4501: StreamMerge: reads stream clicks, which keeps events for 2 DAY after ingestion (LOG RETENTION). Older events are only in the archive.
  hint: query older events with Athena, or aggregate them in a view
dynaflux/clicks.sql:40:8: error DF5206: StreamState: combinator -State is not supported
  hint: use -If, or -Merge in a query over a view
dynaflux/clicks.sql:41:6: warning DF4501: StreamState: reads stream clicks, which keeps events for 2 DAY after ingestion (LOG RETENTION). Older events are only in the archive.
  hint: query older events with Athena, or aggregate them in a view
